You come closer to the dangerous plant and try to cut a branch, but accidentally grab it with your hand. Covered with small drops, the fuzz instantly adheres to your skin. Another moment passes, and both your hands are entrapped.

Irene starts to cry. You try to calm her down, beginning to realize that this is the end. The spots of skin which are unprotected by clothing start to burn. At first, just a bit, but then the burning pain becomes intolerable. There is nobody around, no one will help you. Your adventure ends here.